WEBVTT

1
00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:41.958
MY BELOVED DEMON

2
00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:45.670
{\an8}Are you God?

3
00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:50.341
{\an8}This is one of my names.

4
00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:53.470
{\an8}Some call me the universe.

5
00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.847
{\an8}Others call me time.

6
00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:57.849
{\an8}You know what they say.

7
00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:01.978
{\an8}"God is everywhere and in everything."

8
00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.229
{\an8}I believe you

9
00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:04.689
{\an8}so give it back to me

10
00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:06.775
{\an8}my strength.

11
00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:08.401
{\an8}I can't do it.

12
00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.571
{\an8}- What?
- Although I gave you strength,

13
00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:12.947
{\an8}I did not take them from you.

14
00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:15.742
{\an8}Is this because I didn't sign a new contract?

15
00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:19.204
Will I get my powers back if I make a deal right away?

16
00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:21.164
Agreements will not change anything.

17
00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.208
Since the powers are in the wrong body,

18
00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:26.503
it's only natural that they melt
until they disappear.

19
00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.589
Then I…

20
00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:31.007
That's right.

21
00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:34.469
You are dying as we speak.

22
00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:37.972
Then how do I get my strength back?

23
00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:39.849
There must be a way.

24
00:01:40.558 --> 00:01:41.601
It's simple.

25
00:01:43.186 --> 00:01:44.813
You can get your strength back

26
00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:46.856
as soon as that woman dies.

27
00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:59.285
As soon as the current owner dies,

28
00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:01.371
the tattoo will return to the original owner.

29
00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:02.831
And if she doesn't die?

30
00:02:02.914 --> 00:02:07.085
If she lives to full term,

31
00:02:07.168 --> 00:02:08.753
the tattoo will disappear.

32
00:02:10.713 --> 00:02:13.508
And your existence will be interrupted
due to spontaneous combustion.

33
00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.596
You still put in so much effort
to save her life

34
00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.516
but she must die
to get your strength back.

35
00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.811
What is the point of all this?

36
00:02:26.396 --> 00:02:28.189
Why are you doing this to us?

37
00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:29.983
I cannot know everything, although God does.

38
00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:34.571
The world works in surprisingly imperfect ways.

39
00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:38.324
I'm just making a choice

40
00:02:38.408 --> 00:02:40.910
and the roulette wheel spins exactly.

41
00:02:44.914 --> 00:02:47.917
That's how the world works.

42
00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.253
What kind of irresponsible…

43
00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:53.590
If anyone has to answer, it's you, not me.

44
00:02:54.257 --> 00:02:56.467
Maybe I dictated the rules,

45
00:02:56.551 --> 00:03:00.597
but people are free to choose
and do not follow those rules

46
00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.557
creating many anomalies.

47
00:03:03.141 --> 00:03:05.852
People like to blame fate for everything,

48
00:03:05.935 --> 00:03:09.147
but fate is just a web
woven from myriad choices,

49
00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:10.857
which you do.

50
00:03:16.404 --> 00:03:17.947
He is a demon.

51
00:03:19.407 --> 00:03:21.826
Also known as the devil.

52
00:03:25.079 --> 00:03:26.915
He brings misfortune to people

53
00:03:27.498 --> 00:03:28.791
and leads them to hell.

54
00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:32.420
It's just ridiculous.

55
00:03:32.503 --> 00:03:34.631
I know this is hard to believe.

56
00:03:35.632 --> 00:03:39.802
But you probably understood
that he is not a simple person.

57
00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:42.055
That's why they asked me who he was.

58
00:03:42.138 --> 00:03:44.224
But how can he be the devil?

59
00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:46.434
you say

60
00:03:46.517 --> 00:03:49.979
that To Hee knows who he is
and equally completely trusts him?

61
00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:51.481
It doesn't look like her at all.

62
00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:53.316
A special gift of a demon -

63
00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:55.735
awaken a person's desire and charm him,

64
00:03:56.444 --> 00:03:58.029
thus capturing her heart.

65
00:03:59.781 --> 00:04:01.407
This is how a demon works.

66
00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.582
Director Jeong always
holding To Hee's wrist.

67
00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:11.834
Did you notice it?

68
00:04:13.378 --> 00:04:14.212
Yes.

69
00:04:14.295 --> 00:04:16.547
The demon has special powers.

70
00:04:16.631 --> 00:04:18.341
They are dangerous and powerful.

71
00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:21.219
And they moved on to To To Hee's wrist.

72
00:04:21.803 --> 00:04:22.929
Dad

73
00:04:23.012 --> 00:04:24.889
That's right. Dad

74
00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:27.308
This is the source of his powers.

75
00:04:27.976 --> 00:04:30.478
That's why he needs To To Hee.

76
00:04:31.062 --> 00:04:32.313
To be more precise,

77
00:04:33.523 --> 00:04:35.608
then he needs a tattoo on her wrist.

78
00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.625
<i>Is there no other way?</i>

79
00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:55.586
<i>Isn't there a way for both of us to survive?</i>

80
00:04:56.337 --> 00:04:57.588
unfortunately

81
00:04:58.798 --> 00:04:59.966
there is no

82
00:05:00.049 --> 00:05:03.261
When the moon is full,
the roulette wheel will stop

83
00:05:05.096 --> 00:05:07.015
and game over
whatever the result will be.

84
00:05:17.567 --> 00:05:24.449
EPISODE 10
BREAK THE SHELL

85
00:05:28.745 --> 00:05:29.620
<i>Daddy.</i>

86
00:05:29.704 --> 00:05:31.581
<i>This is the source of his powers.</i>

87
00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:33.791
<i>That's why he needs To To Hee.</i>

88
00:05:33.875 --> 00:05:35.626
He needs a tattoo on her wrist.

89
00:05:37.128 --> 00:05:39.589
<i>What do you get out of a relationship with To Hee?</i>

90
00:05:40.548 --> 00:05:43.926
<i>I don't understand what is the use for you
that you are her husband and guardian.</i>

91
00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.303
I need her.

92
00:05:52.727 --> 00:05:54.812
DEMON: IT'S A GHOST
THE GUARDIAN OR THE DEVIL...

93
00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.108
THE DEVIL

94
00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:01.527
{\an8}DURMAN, 7 DEVILS

95
00:06:06.407 --> 00:06:07.867
{\an8}A WOMAN WAS SACRIFICED

96
00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.286
{\an8}THE DEVIL CHARMED PEOPLE

97
00:06:16.334 --> 00:06:17.502
<i>What are you looking for?</i>

98
00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:21.255
<i>It's over,
because the intruder is dead, isn't he?</i>

99
00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:29.722
come in

100
00:06:34.769 --> 00:06:37.355
It was brought from To To Hee earlier in the afternoon.

101
00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:41.192
WAIVER OF INHERITANCE

102
00:06:41.275 --> 00:06:44.695
Fortunately, she kept her promise.

103
00:06:44.779 --> 00:06:45.822
Greetings, my dear.

104
00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:47.532
What are you talking about, congratulations?

105
00:06:48.116 --> 00:06:49.867
Everything was mine by right

106
00:06:50.368 --> 00:06:51.702
and I just returned everything.

107
00:06:52.411 --> 00:06:53.621
Of course.

108
00:06:54.205 --> 00:06:56.457
You have been through so much.

109
00:07:10.221 --> 00:07:12.765
WAIVER OF INHERITANCE
RECIPIENT: TO TO HI

110
00:07:16.936 --> 00:07:21.274
"ELECTRONIC MIRE" PUBLIC FOR THE FIRST TIME
RECOGNIZED AN ACCIDENT AT THE PRODUCTION

111
00:07:21.357 --> 00:07:27.905
{\an8}2006 YEAR

112
00:07:53.431 --> 00:07:54.307
That's you.

113
00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:55.850
Mom's way out.

114
00:07:57.018 --> 00:08:00.396
From now on you will live with us.

115
00:08:02.273 --> 00:08:04.442
Consider us your family from now on.

116
00:08:05.318 --> 00:08:07.069
At first, everyone says so.

117
00:08:07.945 --> 00:08:09.530
Until the money runs out.

118
00:08:09.614 --> 00:08:12.116
It's not like I promised to love you...

119
00:08:14.076 --> 00:08:15.703
or sprinkle with signs of attention.

120
00:08:15.786 --> 00:08:17.830
And I don't expect them from you.

121
00:08:17.914 --> 00:08:19.165
Mom

122
00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:21.876
That's where you are.

123
00:08:23.044 --> 00:08:24.420
You're To Hee, right?

124
00:08:25.254 --> 00:08:26.172
Congratulations.

125
00:08:52.907 --> 00:08:54.075
EXECUTIVE

126
00:08:59.038 --> 00:09:01.290
GET ONLINE

127
00:09:01.374 --> 00:09:03.709
DELETE

128
00:09:05.253 --> 00:09:07.755
{\an8}DELETE

129
00:09:12.802 --> 00:09:14.595
{\an8}WHY NO WORD FROM YOU?

130
00:09:14.679 --> 00:09:16.681
{\an8}AND DON'T SAY YOU'RE GETTING OUT OF THE GAME.

131
00:09:30.194 --> 00:09:31.988
<i>You can get your strength back,</i>

132
00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:33.281
as soon as that woman dies.

133
00:09:33.364 --> 00:09:34.782
And if she doesn't die?

134
00:09:34.865 --> 00:09:36.450
The tattoo will disappear.

135
00:09:38.411 --> 00:09:41.163
And your existence will be interrupted
due to spontaneous combustion.

136
00:09:44.959 --> 00:09:46.085
What is all this?

137
00:09:48.212 --> 00:09:49.213
Yes, yes.

138
00:09:49.714 --> 00:09:51.299
I made a cake.

139
00:09:53.259 --> 00:09:55.136
But Halloween has already passed.

140
00:09:55.219 --> 00:09:56.470
when is your birthday

141
00:09:57.054 --> 00:09:58.222
I don't have it.

142
00:09:58.306 --> 00:10:00.141
It seemed you were jealous of Christmas

143
00:10:00.224 --> 00:10:02.768
so I wanted to try it
to make you a birthday cake.

144
00:10:04.645 --> 00:10:06.230
What should I write on the cake?

145
00:10:06.314 --> 00:10:07.815
"Good Luck, Demon"?

146
00:10:08.566 --> 00:10:09.734
It sounds amazing.

147
00:10:10.234 --> 00:10:11.569
I'll just write your name.

148
00:10:14.363 --> 00:10:16.866
KU VON

149
00:10:23.456 --> 00:10:24.540
I'm charging.

150
00:10:28.002 --> 00:10:29.253
Did something happen?

151
00:10:31.172 --> 00:10:33.758
No, everything is fine.

152
00:10:36.802 --> 00:10:38.012
Exactly?

153
00:10:39.889 --> 00:10:41.182
You left so suddenly.

154
00:10:41.265 --> 00:10:42.224
where did you go

155
00:10:44.977 --> 00:10:47.104
I went to the theater.

156
00:10:47.188 --> 00:10:49.732
You won't believe how Mr. Park whined.

157
00:10:50.232 --> 00:10:51.317
Did something serious happen?

158
00:10:53.486 --> 00:10:54.654
Everything is already settled.

159
00:10:58.449 --> 00:10:59.950
However,

160
00:11:00.034 --> 00:11:02.078
I think cakes should be baked by experts.

161
00:11:02.161 --> 00:11:05.206
We can always buy a cake
so just stay with me.

162
00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.291
But we have a specialist here.

163
00:11:07.375 --> 00:11:08.834
I

164
00:11:08.918 --> 00:11:10.753
To To Hee, general director of Mire Nutrition.

165
00:11:10.836 --> 00:11:12.797
If I'm not an expert, I don't know who is.

166
00:11:14.048 --> 00:11:16.300
Why are you looking at me so incredulously?

167
00:11:17.802 --> 00:11:19.970
Enjoy a professionally prepared cake.

168
00:11:25.684 --> 00:11:27.311
Well, how? Do you feel professional?

169
00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:31.816
No?

170
00:11:33.401 --> 00:11:34.735
- Amazingly delicious.
- Really?

171
00:11:34.819 --> 00:11:37.488
You immediately feel that this is the work of a specialist.

172
00:11:37.571 --> 00:11:39.907
do you see I told you.

173
00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:41.033
Let me taste.

174
00:11:41.117 --> 00:11:42.535
No!

175
00:11:43.828 --> 00:11:47.415
It's a shame to eat such a masterpiece.

176
00:11:47.498 --> 00:11:50.292
Let's just enjoy its appearance.

177
00:11:50.376 --> 00:11:52.169
Listen, I'm grateful.

178
00:11:52.253 --> 00:11:53.337
So delicious?

179
00:11:54.046 --> 00:11:55.631
You have no idea.

180
00:11:55.714 --> 00:11:56.882
Really?

181
00:11:56.966 --> 00:11:58.968
Then it will be a pity to eat it.

182
00:12:01.595 --> 00:12:02.596
So salty!

183
00:12:03.514 --> 00:12:04.598
Oh no.

184
00:12:04.682 --> 00:12:05.724
But I…

185
00:12:05.808 --> 00:12:07.977
i thought i added sugar

186
00:12:08.519 --> 00:12:10.271
and it must have been salt.

187
00:12:11.689 --> 00:12:13.149
That's why it's delicious.

188
00:12:13.232 --> 00:12:15.526
- You are lying.
- I'm serious.

189
00:12:15.609 --> 00:12:17.445
It can even be sold.

190
00:12:17.528 --> 00:12:19.488
Release it as a new company product.

191
00:12:19.572 --> 00:12:21.740
Salty rolls are in fashion now.

192
00:12:22.575 --> 00:12:24.118
- Salty rolls?
- Yes.

193
00:12:24.201 --> 00:12:26.620
- Do you like them?
- Yes.

194
00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:30.124
Perfectly. Then it is not in vain.

195
00:12:33.544 --> 00:12:34.920
Eat a salty cake.

196
00:12:36.255 --> 00:12:37.798
Here is the salt.

197
00:12:41.135 --> 00:12:42.720
I had lunch, so I'm not hungry.

198
00:12:42.803 --> 00:12:44.221
But it's really tasty.

199
00:12:44.305 --> 00:12:46.015
- Eat. Taste the cake.
- No, thank you.

200
00:12:49.477 --> 00:12:51.270
I love the smell of the night.

201
00:12:51.979 --> 00:12:54.231
Are you not afraid of heights now?

202
00:12:54.315 --> 00:12:55.483
I don't know exactly.

203
00:12:56.984 --> 00:12:57.902
But...

204
00:12:58.486 --> 00:13:00.696
as I look at your face
all fears disappear.

205
00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:02.823
Maybe because you are my keeper.

206
00:13:05.951 --> 00:13:08.037
If tomorrow was the end of the world,

207
00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:09.163
what would you do

208
00:13:09.663 --> 00:13:11.499
And why does the world have to end?

209
00:13:12.541 --> 00:13:16.378
From a sudden whim of fate, probably.

210
00:13:16.962 --> 00:13:18.214
The vagaries of fate?

211
00:13:20.049 --> 00:13:22.718
Then, I think, nothing can be done here.

212
00:13:24.303 --> 00:13:25.429
How terrible.

213
00:13:25.513 --> 00:13:27.264
Just have to watch the end of the world?

214
00:13:30.392 --> 00:13:31.602
In that case

215
00:13:33.103 --> 00:13:34.396
I would just…

216
00:13:36.524 --> 00:13:39.902
was at home all day

217
00:13:40.528 --> 00:13:42.196
and was lazy.

218
00:13:43.113 --> 00:13:46.909
I would sleep for a long time, joking with you.

219
00:13:48.744 --> 00:13:51.413
I would spend the day in peace,

220
00:13:51.497 --> 00:13:53.123
as if it could last forever.

221
00:13:53.916 --> 00:13:56.585
That's the best I could do

222
00:13:56.669 --> 00:13:58.087
so that fate does not play with me.

223
00:14:01.924 --> 00:14:03.050
AND?

224
00:14:03.634 --> 00:14:04.843
- And?
- Yes.

225
00:14:09.139 --> 00:14:11.183
We could walk together all day.

226
00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:14.103
we would save the world
which will disappear the next day

227
00:14:14.186 --> 00:14:15.938
etched in memory.

228
00:14:18.482 --> 00:14:19.316
AND?

229
00:14:19.817 --> 00:14:20.651
AND?

230
00:14:21.777 --> 00:14:23.195
The day can't be that long.

231
00:14:25.823 --> 00:14:27.950
There is something you would like to do

232
00:14:29.034 --> 00:14:30.452
alone?

233
00:14:31.579 --> 00:14:32.872
No.

234
00:14:32.955 --> 00:14:34.999
I want to spend
my last day with you

235
00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:48.804
Let's not stay up all night today.

236
00:14:49.388 --> 00:14:50.306
Why?

237
00:14:50.931 --> 00:14:52.850
It just seems

238
00:14:52.933 --> 00:14:56.186
it's such a waste to sleep through the night.

239
00:14:59.023 --> 00:15:01.525
No. I have to work tomorrow.

240
00:15:02.943 --> 00:15:06.196
We will take care of tomorrow.

241
00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.531
today

242
00:15:08.949 --> 00:15:11.118
you have to party until the sun comes up.

243
00:15:11.702 --> 00:15:14.038
- What are you doing?
- This is a devilish temptation.

244
00:15:14.955 --> 00:15:16.373
OK.

245
00:15:16.957 --> 00:15:18.792
I am very good at staying awake at night.

246
00:15:18.876 --> 00:15:20.586
I understand, you are very good at everything,

247
00:15:20.669 --> 00:15:22.379
- and you can do that too?
- Yes.

248
00:15:22.463 --> 00:15:23.797
- Exactly?
- Yes.

249
00:15:50.115 --> 00:15:53.285
I thought it was from the look
do fears disappear on my face?

250
00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.832
And there is no use from the keeper,
when you watch horror movies.

251
00:16:01.418 --> 00:16:03.712
Does that really scare you?

252
00:16:06.215 --> 00:16:07.675
And what scares you?

253
00:16:11.762 --> 00:16:12.888
Again,

254
00:16:12.972 --> 00:16:15.724
such things do not frighten a demon.

255
00:16:47.172 --> 00:16:48.674
How boring until the end.

256
00:16:57.349 --> 00:16:59.143
You have the ability to stay up all night.

257
00:17:13.115 --> 00:17:14.616
It scares me...

258
00:17:17.161 --> 00:17:18.412
your disappearance…

259
00:17:20.789 --> 00:17:22.124
from this world

260
00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.047
What scares me the most...

261
00:17:31.383 --> 00:17:32.843
the world without you

262
00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:54.698
THE END

263
00:18:01.997 --> 00:18:03.123
Jung Ku Won.

264
00:18:04.374 --> 00:18:05.626
don't go

265
00:18:07.878 --> 00:18:09.505
stay with me

266
00:18:16.053 --> 00:18:17.888
I can't be with you anymore.

267
00:18:19.765 --> 00:18:20.808
Why not?

268
00:18:22.059 --> 00:18:23.227
I will go

269
00:18:24.228 --> 00:18:25.270
Far, far…

270
00:18:27.147 --> 00:18:28.524
where you can't go

271
00:18:34.196 --> 00:18:36.198
I will come for you.

272
00:18:39.952 --> 00:18:40.994
I…

