548
00:38:40.067 --> 00:38:41.068
if i told you

549
00:38:42.194 --> 00:38:43.237
you would refuse

550
00:38:49.076 --> 00:38:50.995
<i>I can't be with you anymore.</i>

551
00:38:51.620 --> 00:38:52.747
I will go

552
00:38:53.748 --> 00:38:54.957
Far, far…

553
00:38:55.875 --> 00:38:57.209
where you can't go

554
00:39:33.120 --> 00:39:33.954
To To Hee.

555
00:39:38.584 --> 00:39:39.585
Come on.

556
00:39:42.129 --> 00:39:44.799
Let's find a way to get your tattoo back.

557
00:39:46.050 --> 00:39:49.011
We can't just die like that
after everything you've been through.

558
00:39:50.930 --> 00:39:53.891
Even if you have to jump
into the sea hundreds and thousands of times,

559
00:39:53.974 --> 00:39:57.103
i will make sure
so that dad comes back to you.

560
00:39:57.186 --> 00:39:58.854
I will do anything…

561
00:40:12.743 --> 00:40:14.161
I'll do anything too.

562
00:40:15.704 --> 00:40:16.789
Absolutely everything.

563
00:40:34.223 --> 00:40:40.062
"SUNVOL FOUNDATION"

564
00:40:40.146 --> 00:40:43.774
I came to ask you about daddy
about which you spoke that time.

565
00:40:44.942 --> 00:40:46.902
Will it put To Hee in danger?

566
00:40:48.279 --> 00:40:49.572
I don't mind.

567
00:40:51.740 --> 00:40:53.075
But one thing is certain.

568
00:40:53.659 --> 00:40:56.996
No man was destined for a happy ending
after meeting with Director Jeon.

569
00:40:59.039 --> 00:41:00.958
Will she live in hell

570
00:41:02.543 --> 00:41:04.253
will her soul go to hell.

571
00:41:06.630 --> 00:41:08.215
She will still end up in hell.

572
00:41:09.592 --> 00:41:11.177
I can't sit back.

573
00:41:11.719 --> 00:41:13.220
I have to stop him.

574
00:41:18.184 --> 00:41:20.019
Today is our last chance.

575
00:42:02.770 --> 00:42:05.064
how to think
now it will be your birthday.

576
00:42:08.275 --> 00:42:10.444
You will be reborn as a perfect demon.

577
00:42:11.320 --> 00:42:13.739
Probably, that's why I wanted
make you a cake

578
00:42:14.240 --> 00:42:16.700
This time, let it be proper.

579
00:42:20.412 --> 00:42:21.956
nice to think

580
00:42:22.456 --> 00:42:25.209
that it will be my birthday

581
00:42:42.017 --> 00:42:43.519
<i>Haven't you forgotten about our agreement?</i>

582
00:42:45.688 --> 00:42:47.189
<i>We have one destiny, haven't we forgotten?</i>

583
00:42:47.273 --> 00:42:49.900
Never forget that we are in the same boat.

584
00:42:50.526 --> 00:42:51.360
It's too high here!

585
00:42:53.862 --> 00:42:55.614
I am the bodyguard of the bodyguard!

586
00:43:02.162 --> 00:43:03.747
<i>Why did you confess to me?</i>

587
00:43:03.831 --> 00:43:05.082
I don't want you to die.

588
00:43:05.165 --> 00:43:07.126
Stop! Wait a second.

589
00:43:07.209 --> 00:43:09.253
This was not according to the agreement: "the rest of life"?

590
00:43:15.718 --> 00:43:18.637
<i>I'm just trying
accept you as you are.</i>

591
00:43:19.722 --> 00:43:22.474
<i>It seems that the demons were the guardians of mankind.</i>

592
00:43:22.975 --> 00:43:26.020
<i>Then you came back
to its primary being.</i>

593
00:43:26.937 --> 00:43:28.355
You are my keeper.

594
00:43:41.160 --> 00:43:43.329
<i>Everyone I loved in my life is dead.</i>

595
00:43:44.246 --> 00:43:45.080
<i>And you will die too...</i>

596
00:43:46.040 --> 00:43:47.082
through me

597
00:43:47.166 --> 00:43:48.000
I don't care.

598
00:43:51.170 --> 00:43:53.255
<i>If tomorrow was the end of the world,</i>

599
00:43:53.339 --> 00:43:56.091
<i>is there something you would like to do yourself?</i>

600
00:43:56.592 --> 00:43:57.801
No.

601
00:43:57.885 --> 00:44:00.220
I want to spend
my last day with you

602
00:44:46.558 --> 00:44:47.559
Come on?

603
00:44:50.396 --> 00:44:51.397
Come on.

604
00:45:11.667 --> 00:45:17.673
{\an8}EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR JEONG KOO WON

605
00:45:27.891 --> 00:45:29.059
Director Chon.

606
00:45:50.789 --> 00:45:52.040
<i>Let's get started</i>

607
00:45:52.124 --> 00:45:55.461
36th special meeting
shareholders of "Mire Group".

608
00:45:58.088 --> 00:45:59.089
Suk Mine.

609
00:45:59.965 --> 00:46:02.801
What if it's a poisonous gift or something?

610
00:46:02.885 --> 00:46:05.721
We can fall to the bottom if we take it.

611
00:46:05.804 --> 00:46:08.182
Council recommended

612
00:46:08.265 --> 00:46:11.143
Acting Chairman No Suk Min
for the position of chairman.

613
00:46:11.727 --> 00:46:14.104
You should not dream of rising higher,

614
00:46:14.188 --> 00:46:16.315
if you don't dare to fall to the bottom.

615
00:46:23.780 --> 00:46:25.157
Where is To Kyung?

616
00:46:25.949 --> 00:46:28.118
He is sick.

617
00:46:29.036 --> 00:46:30.245
Again?

618
00:46:30.329 --> 00:46:32.831
He is sick too much for his age.

619
00:46:32.915 --> 00:46:34.249
let's vote

620
00:46:34.333 --> 00:46:37.961
whether to elect Mr. Noh as head.

621
00:46:44.676 --> 00:46:47.304
I hope it turns out better
than last time in the Han River.

622
00:46:49.890 --> 00:46:51.808
Thank you for warning me in advance now.

623
00:46:54.603 --> 00:46:57.272
It was a rehearsal for the current event.

624
00:46:59.691 --> 00:47:00.776
Almost arrived.

625
00:47:02.236 --> 00:47:04.655
Everything is coming soon

626
00:47:05.781 --> 00:47:06.990
will return to normal.

627
00:47:16.500 --> 00:47:18.919
RUNNING OUT OF FUEL

628
00:47:36.353 --> 00:47:37.813
Let me pay for her.

629
00:47:37.896 --> 00:47:39.189
What is it?

630
00:47:39.273 --> 00:47:40.148
Postcard.

631
00:47:40.732 --> 00:47:42.276
In memory of today.

632
00:47:44.528 --> 00:47:48.198
Wait, maybe we'll buy a cake
to celebrate later?

633
00:47:48.782 --> 00:47:49.992
Let's see what they have.

634
00:47:50.909 --> 00:47:52.744
- Buy a strawberry cake.
- Good.

635
00:48:10.429 --> 00:48:12.055
<i>Haven't you figured it out yet?</i>

636
00:48:12.139 --> 00:48:13.140
With the girls.

637
00:48:14.516 --> 00:48:15.684
Vladnav

638
00:48:21.440 --> 00:48:23.734
EXECUTIVE

639
00:48:25.235 --> 00:48:27.237
But Suk Mine!

640
00:48:47.257 --> 00:48:48.091
EXECUTIVE

641
00:48:52.012 --> 00:48:53.722
My phone is here.

642
00:48:54.640 --> 00:48:56.767
How come you have exactly the same one?

643
00:49:02.022 --> 00:49:04.691
I stamp the lessons on your body,
so that you remember them better

644
00:49:04.775 --> 00:49:07.861
but later you forget forever.

645
00:49:23.627 --> 00:49:24.878
As I said

646
00:49:25.879 --> 00:49:28.423
i will fix you

647
00:49:32.094 --> 00:49:35.722
Prove to me that you're worth something.

648
00:49:51.822 --> 00:49:53.573
SELF-SERVICE CASHIER

649
00:49:53.657 --> 00:49:55.075
CREDIT CARD
MAKE PAYMENT

650
00:50:01.873 --> 00:50:03.166
<i>I beg you.</i>

651
00:50:03.250 --> 00:50:04.543
Please save Principal Jeon.

652
00:50:42.831 --> 00:50:44.916
- Hello, Seok Hoon.
- Where are you? are you alone

653
00:50:45.751 --> 00:50:47.419
<i>This is so unexpected.</i>

654
00:50:47.502 --> 00:50:48.420
answer

655
00:50:48.503 --> 00:50:49.921
Are you with Director Jeon Koo Won?

656
00:50:52.966 --> 00:50:53.925
Yes.

657
00:50:54.009 --> 00:50:55.594
But he is not near me now.

658
00:50:55.677 --> 00:50:56.928
You are in danger.

659
00:50:57.429 --> 00:50:59.097
Do not approach him.

660
00:51:00.182 --> 00:51:01.141
<i>I know</i>

661
00:51:01.641 --> 00:51:02.893
what is he

662
00:51:09.399 --> 00:51:11.151
I'm going to see you.

663
00:51:11.234 --> 00:51:14.029
- So stay away from him...
<i>- I understand what you are saying,</i>

664
00:51:14.112 --> 00:51:15.781
but everything is wrong.

665
00:51:15.864 --> 00:51:17.365
He would never do that.

666
00:51:17.449 --> 00:51:19.242
He's cheating you, To Hee.

667
00:51:19.826 --> 00:51:22.037
Do you know why he took you all the way there?

668
00:51:22.120 --> 00:51:24.748
To save myself by killing you!

669
00:51:31.880 --> 00:51:33.799
sorry I hang up.

670
00:51:33.882 --> 00:51:35.550
<i>Votes have been counted.</i>

671
00:51:36.134 --> 00:51:39.262
Having received more than 78.5% of the votes,

672
00:51:39.346 --> 00:51:43.225
Mr. No Suk Min is elected
head of "Mire Group".

673
00:51:51.566 --> 00:51:52.400
To To Hee!

674
00:52:15.173 --> 00:52:16.007
To Hee

675
00:52:29.104 --> 00:52:29.938
To Hee!

676
00:52:42.993 --> 00:52:44.160
No, Director Chong.

677
00:52:44.244 --> 00:52:46.329
You are only human now.

678
00:52:46.413 --> 00:52:47.998
You will die if you go in there!

679
00:52:49.207 --> 00:52:50.041
let go

680
00:52:51.084 --> 00:52:52.335
Just turn away.

681
00:52:52.419 --> 00:52:55.547
To To Hee must die for you to live!

682
00:52:57.924 --> 00:52:59.092
I can't live without her.

683
00:53:29.164 --> 00:53:30.332
Ms Chin,

684
00:53:30.999 --> 00:53:32.042
what was that

685
00:53:33.335 --> 00:53:35.253
Does To Hee have to die for him to live?

686
00:53:36.171 --> 00:53:37.464
Now it's all over.

687
00:53:40.050 --> 00:53:41.509
They will both die.

688
00:53:43.053 --> 00:53:44.012
No.

689
00:53:44.554 --> 00:53:45.388
To Hee…

690
00:53:49.893 --> 00:53:50.936
No.

691
00:54:03.448 --> 00:54:05.200
People are always choosing

692
00:54:05.283 --> 00:54:08.828
one or the other.

693
00:54:09.537 --> 00:54:11.748
Whether they want it or not

694
00:54:11.831 --> 00:54:14.626
such is their fate.

695
00:55:09.848 --> 00:55:12.934
<i>If we ever have to
to make a cruel choice,</i>

696
00:55:14.144 --> 00:55:15.687
<i>I will choose you.</i>

697
00:55:16.980 --> 00:55:18.440
<i>Because I know,</i>

698
00:55:18.523 --> 00:55:21.651
What is worse than losing a loved one
than to lose yourself.</i>

699
00:55:23.903 --> 00:55:26.531
<i>Please don't hate my choice.</i>

700
00:55:27.615 --> 00:55:30.744
<i>Please forgive me for dooming you</i>

701
00:55:31.828 --> 00:55:33.288
<i>to the hell she herself went through.</i>

702
00:55:48.303 --> 00:55:49.512
To To Hee!

703
00:56:04.944 --> 00:56:07.947
<i>Remembering the value of trust,
which I learned from my mother,</i>

704
00:56:09.032 --> 00:56:11.743
I will restore the former glory of "Mire Group".

705
00:56:16.915 --> 00:56:19.125
{\an8}CHAPTER NO SUK MIN

706
00:56:20.460 --> 00:56:21.544
Mom

707
00:56:23.338 --> 00:56:24.881
Are you happy now?

708
00:56:24.964 --> 00:56:26.341
"MIRE GROUP"

709
00:56:27.175 --> 00:56:30.095
I became a devil, as you wanted.

710
00:56:53.034 --> 00:56:54.327
Please hurry.

711
00:56:54.410 --> 00:56:55.870
People are inside!

712
00:56:58.248 --> 00:56:59.082
hurry up

713
00:58:33.510 --> 00:58:34.719
How…

714
00:58:49.234 --> 00:58:50.276
To To Hee.

715
00:59:04.874 --> 00:59:05.875
To To Hee.

716
00:59:37.532 --> 00:59:38.616
Dad...

717
00:59:42.287 --> 00:59:43.413
came back to me

718
01:00:09.564 --> 01:00:12.233
MY BELOVED DEMON

719
01:00:47.602 --> 01:00:50.563
{\an8}Congratulations. You don't blink anymore
and you don't need to recharge.

720
01:00:50.647 --> 01:00:51.648
{\an8}<i>You still need to recharge.</i>

721
01:00:52.440 --> 01:00:53.775
{\an8}Go away!

722
01:00:54.442 --> 01:00:55.485
{\an8}<i>Wolsim!</i>

723
01:00:55.568 --> 01:00:57.153
{\an8}<i>Why do I still dream of being human</i>

724
01:00:57.236 --> 01:00:59.197
{\an8}if my powers are back?

725
01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:02.575
{\an8}<i>Maybe you want to stay human.</i>

726
01:01:03.076 --> 01:01:05.620
{\an8}<i>So they survived the fiery hell?</i>

727
01:01:05.703 --> 01:01:07.246
{\an8}<i>The intruder knew we were in Sokcho.</i>

728
01:01:07.330 --> 01:01:08.790
{\an8}<i>Someone leaked information about us.</i>

729
01:01:08.873 --> 01:01:10.792
{\an8}The fact that we are in Sokcho was known only...

730
01:01:10.875 --> 01:01:12.126
{\an8}I came to take your side.

731
01:01:12.210 --> 01:01:15.338
{\an8}<i>Let's resolve old conflicts
and from now on let's cooperate.</i>

732
01:01:18.925 --> 01:01:23.930
Translation of subtitles: Daria Hochel

